# Python Environment

- Run Python commands for this project through the `SFM` conda environment.
- Prefer `conda run -n SFM python ...` for scripts, smoke tests, and one-off checks.
- Prefer `conda run -n SFM python -m py_compile ...` when checking Python syntax.
- Do not use the system `python` or `python3` for dependency-sensitive checks unless the user explicitly asks.
